    <skos:prefLabel>anatomical set</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>A set may be a complete or partial set of given entities; i.e. "set of Xes" may be either all or just some of the Xes in the super group.  E.g. "set of upper extremity vessels" may be used to refer to all the blood vessels of the upper extremity, or to some subset of them.</skos:definition>
