    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://radlex.org/RID/RID5978"/>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>Organ component constituted by specialized tissues which are organized into acini, lobules, segments, and lobes, or corticomedullary units and supported by stroma. Examples: parenchyma of lung, parenchyma of liver, parenchyma of kidney.</cde:sourceDefinition>
    <cde:conceptSource>Fleischner Society</cde:conceptSource>
